<</AP<</N 39928 0 R >>/Border[ 0 0 0]/Contents(- The measles virus is a highly contagious virus that causes measles, a serious respiratory illness.\n- An enveloped virus with a single-stranded RNA genome.\n- Spread through respiratory droplets when an infected person coughs or sneezes.\n- Initial symptoms include high fever, cough, runny nose, and conjunctivitis \(red, watery eyes\).\n- Can lead to serious complications, especially in young children and immunocompromised individuals, such as pneumonia, encephalitis \(brain inflammation\), and death.\n- Can cause long-term effects like subacute sclerosing panencephalitis \(SSPE\), a rare but fatal brain disorder.)/DA(/Helv 15 Tf 0 Tc 16.8 TL 0.8 0 0 rg )/F 4/PDFIUM_HasGeneratedAP true/Rect[ 18.8178 203.742 417.985 405.827]/Rotate 0/Subtype/FreeText/Type/Annot>>
